       <div class="meta"><span class="beat-tag">EDUCATION</span> · Education (aggregate) · 2026-10-26 · editor 7/10 · 1 min read <span class="badge ok">fact-checked</span><span class="badge quick">quick bite</span></div>
       <h1>Canadian Education Council Launches International Employment License in Maharashtra</h1>
       <div class="tags"><span>#Education</span> <span>#Careers</span> <span>#Maharashtra</span> <span>#Canada</span></div>
       <p>The Canadian Education Council has initiated the rollout of its International Employment License, commencing operations in Maharashtra. This development marks a significant step for the council in facilitating international employment opportunities within India.</p><img class="hero-art" src="/img/2026-10-26/canadian-education-council-launches-international-employment.webp" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><p>The council's stated objective is to expand the reach of this International Employment License beyond Maharashtra, aiming for a nationwide implementation across India. Further details regarding the rollout schedule or specific eligibility criteria were not provided in the announcement.</p><p>What to watch: Rollout across other Indian states.</p>
       <p class="critique">Editor's note: Well-handled brief that makes full use of the minimal source material.</p>
