     <article class="story single" data-beat="defence">
       <div class="meta"><span class="beat-tag">DEFENCE</span> · Defence (aggregate) · 2026-10-26 · editor 9/10 · 1 min read <span class="badge ok">fact-checked</span></div>
       <h1>DAC Clears ₹2.12 Lakh Crore Defence Proposals for Armed Forces</h1>
       <div class="tags"><span>#Defence Acquisition Council</span> <span>#Indian Armed Forces</span> <span>#Defence Procurement</span> <span>#Make in India</span></div>
       <p>The Defence Acquisition Council (DAC) has cleared defence acquisition proposals worth ₹2.12 lakh crore for the Indian Army, Navy, and Air Force, as reported by SSBCrack. The Times of India stated that these proposals include drones, guns, and missile shields, while India Today added helicopters and air defence systems to the list of cleared items.</p><img class="hero-art" src="/img/2026-10-26/dac-clears-212-lakh-crore-defence-proposals-for-armed-forces.webp" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><p>This significant defence push, valued at ₹2.12 lakh crore, has received DAC's nod, with The Economic Times highlighting that 82% of this allocation is earmarked for Indian firms. This emphasis on domestic procurement underscores a focus on strengthening indigenous defence manufacturing capabilities.</p><p>The approved proposals aim to enhance the operational readiness and capabilities of the Armed Forces across multiple domains. The inclusion of drones, helicopters, air defence systems, guns, and missile shields suggests a comprehensive upgrade strategy addressing various aspects of modern warfare.</p><p>What to watch: Further details on specific procurements and the timeline for their execution.</p>
       <p class="critique">Editor's note: The draft accurately aggregates the provided information from multiple sources and presents the key figures clearly.</p>
       <div class="provenance">
      <b>Source</b>
      <ul><li><a href="https://news.google.?oc=5&amp;hl=en-US&amp;gl=US&amp;ceid=US:en" rel="noopener">Defence (aggregate)</a></li></ul>
      <p>AI-generated and fact-checked against the original report; claims the gate cannot verify are held back.</p>
    </div>
       
       <div class="sharebar" data-href="/article/2026-10-26/dac-clears-212-lakh-crore-defence-proposals-for-armed-forces" data-title="DAC Clears ₹2.12 Lakh Crore Defence Proposals for Armed Forces"><b>Share:</b>
