      <ul><li><a href="https://www.news18.com/india/cyclone-arnab-live-updates-imd-forecast-landfall-date-time-deep-depression-bay-of-bengal-heavy-rains-warning-alert-odisha-andhra-pradesh-weather-schools-latest-news-liveblog-10397389.html" rel="noopener">News18 India</a></li></ul>
      <p>AI-generated and fact-checked against the original report; claims the gate cannot verify are held back.</p>
    </div>
       
