      <ul><li><a href="https://www.crictracker.com/cricket-news/jharkhand-files-bcci-complaint-alleges-scorer-error-after-one-run-loss-ends-womens-under-19-campaign/" rel="noopener">Crictracker</a></li></ul>
      <p>AI-generated and fact-checked against the original report; claims the gate cannot verify are held back.</p>
    </div>
       
