     <article class="story single" data-beat="national">
       <div class="meta"><span class="beat-tag">NATIONAL</span> · The Hindu · 2026-10-26 · editor 9/10 · 1 min read <span class="badge ok">fact-checked</span></div>
       <h1>Mysuru Dasara Exhibition Ground Gains Popularity as Year-Round Attraction</h1>
       <div class="tags"><span>#national</span> <span>#brief</span></div>
       <p>The Dasara Exhibition Ground in Mysuru has become a top visitor destination, featuring an 800-metre musical fountain, the Rajiv Gandhi Dragon Pond with boating, and a Disneyland flower replica. The Karnataka Exhibition Authority (KEA) continues to enhance the venue with permanent heritage-style structures to accommodate commercial stalls and cultural programs.</p><img class="hero-art" src="/img/2026-10-26/mysuru-dasara-exhibition-ground-gains-popularity-as-year-rou.webp" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><p>To improve visitor comfort, KEA installed interlocking pavers for walking paths and maintains year-round operations. Attractions include a 3D dome show, amusement rides, and government-run information stalls. Given the high demand, the KEA plans to retain the dragon pond attraction and upgrade the facility to ensure it remains a premier entertainment hub for all age groups.</p>
       <p class="critique">Editor's note: Concise summary of the exhibition ground's status, features, and recent infrastructure upgrades.</p>
       <div class="provenance">
      <b>Source</b>
      <ul><li><a href="https://www.thehindu.com/news/national/karnataka/multiple-attractions-draw-visitors-to-dasara-exhibition-ground-in-mysuru/article71626843.ece" rel="noopener">The Hindu</a></li></ul>
      <p>AI-generated and fact-checked against the original report; claims the gate cannot verify are held back.</p>
    </div>
       <div class="cityguide"><b>City guide</b><p>More on <a href="https://bharatdn.com/city/mysuru/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Mysuru</a> - census 2011 population, live weather and air quality, local food and getaways.</p></div>
