      <ul><li><a href="https://www.thehindu.com/news/national/political-line-local-national-and-anti-national/article65042538.ece" rel="noopener">The Hindu</a></li></ul>
      <p>AI-generated and fact-checked against the original report; claims the gate cannot verify are held back.</p>
