     <article class="story single" data-beat="national">
       <div class="meta"><span class="beat-tag">NATIONAL</span> · The Hindu · 2026-10-26 · editor 10/10 · 1 min read <span class="badge ok">fact-checked</span><span class="badge quick">quick bite</span></div>
       <h1>Signal work at Kalamassery station forces Vande Bharat cancellations</h1>
       <div class="tags"><span>#national</span> <span>#brief</span></div>
       <p>Major signal infrastructure improvements at Kalamassery railway station will disrupt several train services on October 27, 2026. The KSR Bengaluru-Ernakulam Junction Vande Bharat Express will be short-terminated at Thrissur, with the service between Thrissur and Ernakulam cancelled in both directions.</p><img class="hero-art" src="/img/2026-10-26/signal-work-at-kalamassery-station-forces-vande-bharat-cance.webp" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><p>Additionally, the Ernakulam Junction-Hazrat Nizamuddin Mangala Lakshadweep Superfast Express will be rescheduled, departing 90 minutes later than its original 1:25 p.m. slot. Numerous other trains, including the Parasuram Express and Netravati Express, face regulatory delays ranging from 15 minutes to over an hour due to the infrastructure work.</p>
       <p class="critique">Editor's note: Direct and completely faithful to the source schedule changes.</p>
       <div class="provenance">
      <b>Source</b>
      <ul><li><a href="https://www.thehindu.com/news/national/kerala/train-services-to-be-regulated-for-signal-work-at-kalamassery-station-on-oct-27/article71628085.ece" rel="noopener">The Hindu</a></li></ul>
      <p>AI-generated and fact-checked against the original report; claims the gate cannot verify are held back.</p>
    </div>
       
       <div class="sharebar" data-href="/article/2026-10-26/signal-work-at-kalamassery-station-forces-vande-bharat-cance" data-title="Signal work at Kalamassery station forces Vande Bharat cancellations"><b>Share:</b>
